															<div class="game_description_snippet">
									&quot;Keyboard Farm&quot; is a desktop idle farming game. Place it on your desktop and focus on your work. Every key is a plot of land—each keystroke helps plants grow. Harvest crops to collect coins, unlock various keycaps, and create your own keyboard world.								</div>
